                                        "Ayusin mo sarili mo.",
                                        "Sapat na.",
                                        "Huwag sa akin.",
                                        "Lumagpas ka na.",
                                        "Umatras ka.",
                                    },
                                },
                            },
                            {
                                ["fallback"] = "Hey, where is this hostility coming from? We're allies.",
                                ["id"] = "warm",
                                ["templateID"] = "convo.social.hostile_boundary.say.1.warm",
                                ["textRole"] = "spoken_action",
                                ["translations"] = {
                                    ["EN"] = {
                                        "Hey, where is this hostility coming from? We're allies.",
                                        "Don't snap at me like that. I've only ever helped you.",
